"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4575190","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4175430-1844115010500136","game_id":"steam-4175430","kind":"announcement","title":"The Red Window Demo 0.8.2","summary":"The Red Window — Demo 0.8.2Bug Fixes & ImprovementsFixed an issue where player movement could continue unexpectedly while examining certain items.Fixed an issue where examination interactions could behave incorrectly when activated while the player was already moving.Fixed an input issue during the opening sequence that could allow player controls to become active when they should remain disabled.Fixed an issue with crouching and collision that could interfere with navigating tight spaces and cr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T02:13:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010500136","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4175430-1836506165564276","game_id":"steam-4175430","kind":"update","title":"The Red Window Demo Update v0.8","summary":"Update 0.8 — Demo Overhaul & Presentation UpdateThis update focuses on improving immersion, reducing UI friction, and refining the overall presentation of The Red Window based on player feedback and internal testing. Major Features & Improvements New Sense-Based Waypoint SystemA new optional Sense-driven item guidance system has been introduced to reduce UI clutter and improve immersion.Objective waypoints now appear through the Sense mechanic instead of persistent UI overlaysDesigned to reduce ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T04:20:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165564276","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4175430-1832700592793162","game_id":"steam-4175430","kind":"update","title":"The Red Window Update 0.6","summary":"The Red Window — Update 0.6This update focuses heavily on reducing gameplay friction and improving progression clarity throughout the demo.ChangesImproved event triggering to ensure important moments occur reliably without requiring precise player positioning or interaction timing.Added and refined forced-look event sequences to better direct player attention during critical moments.Adjusted progression flow so key objectives and interactable objects are easier to notice.Fixed several cases wher","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-15T21:01:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592793162","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4175430-1830163047265125","game_id":"steam-4175430","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.4","summary":"This update adds new gameplay mechanics, improves player control options, and refines overall stability based on feedback.New Gameplay FeaturesFlashlight Beam Mechanic A new defensive flashlight ability has been added that allows players to briefly stall enemies during encounters. This adds an additional layer of interaction during stealth situations and improves survivability under pressure. The flashlight ability cooldown is illustrated at the top of the screen with a bar that fills up from th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-20T05:09:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047265125","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4175430-1829528821316742","game_id":"steam-4175430","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch v0.1 – Stability & Gameplay Improvements","summary":"Demo Update – Patch Notes Quality of Life ImprovementsEnhanced Footage Review SystemAdded contextual dialogue hints during footage playbackFootage now auto-pauses at key clue momentsNew interactive mouse reveal mechanic for discovering important detailsAdditional dialogue plays upon discovery to clarify contextImproved Progression ClarityAdded a subtle visual pulse effect to breakable planks to improve discoverabilityNew “look-at” behavior helps guide player attention during explorationSettings ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-14T01:41:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821316742","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4175430-1827626365751238","game_id":"steam-4175430","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO Coming Soon!","summary":"I am hard at work finishing this vertical slice for players to enjoy, you'll get a taste of the narrative and a solid 30 minutes of first person found footage gameplay and puzzle solving! The demo is coming soon, and it will be an early chance to experience the unsettling exploration and gameplay in The Red Window. Thank you to anyone who has wish listed so far, I am excited to deliver a quality horror experience to the indie horror community.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-18T19:15:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365751238","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4175430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:15Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4175430":"